WEBVTT

00:19.820 --> 00:24.158
The wound inside
my sealed memories

00:24.158 --> 00:28.829
When it silently touches the heart

00:28.829 --> 00:36.537
Tears of loneliness behind
the gentle smile

00:36.537 --> 00:41.342
I seek boundless strength

00:41.342 --> 00:52.119
I continue to run up with
what I believe in

00:52.119 --> 00:54.221
I want to protect

00:54.221 --> 00:56.490
I want to believe

00:56.490 --> 01:00.794
all the reasons for that smile

01:00.794 --> 01:05.132
The heat and the love

01:05.132 --> 01:09.370
I accept them all

01:09.370 --> 01:13.040
I won't let go of your hand again

01:13.040 --> 01:21.744
Aiming towards that light...

01:31.358 --> 01:34.691
Previously on Shonen Onmyouji...

01:39.600 --> 01:41.431
Do you feel hatred?

01:42.269 --> 01:45.906
Masahiro... has been
feeling down lately...

01:45.906 --> 01:49.410
So I thought of getting him some
tasty food to cheer him up.

01:49.410 --> 01:52.106
- Dried apricots and peaches.
- Right! Thank you.

02:00.587 --> 02:03.857
The curse can't be stopped
once it has been cast...

02:03.857 --> 02:06.519
until Yukinari dies.

02:07.094 --> 02:08.996
I'll revoke it.

02:08.996 --> 02:12.261
Toshitsugu will lose his life
if you do that.

02:13.400 --> 02:18.238
You'll have to kill Toshitsugu
to save Yukinari's life.

02:18.238 --> 02:20.240
Are you prepared
to do that?

02:20.240 --> 02:21.798
But what else can I do?!

02:23.610 --> 02:26.807
Release the Catastrophic Chains

02:28.615 --> 02:31.085
The grave has been disturbed.

02:31.085 --> 02:33.320
It seems that someone
or something...

02:33.320 --> 02:35.155
has awakened a sleeping soul.

02:35.155 --> 02:36.782
Yeah...

02:38.225 --> 02:40.594
There's his name.

02:40.594 --> 02:45.224
I'll send a message to
Seimei using the wind.

02:57.945 --> 03:00.514
It's a message from Byakko.

03:00.514 --> 03:03.383
We discovered an open grave
at Daizafu.

03:03.383 --> 03:05.919
It was the grave of
Hozumi no Moronao.

03:05.919 --> 03:09.156
There are signs that
a resurrection spell was cast.

03:09.156 --> 03:13.684
So somebody brought Hozumi no
Moronao back to life.

03:17.598 --> 03:20.501
Who is this Hozumi
no Moronao?

03:20.501 --> 03:24.037
Moronao was a nobleman
who was exiled to Daizafu,

03:24.037 --> 03:28.308
because he used the Cursing
Jewel to hurt a political enemy.

03:28.308 --> 03:30.711
An exiled nobleman?

03:30.711 --> 03:34.977
Mokkun, remember that house
where we first saw the onryou?

03:36.049 --> 03:39.507
Tell me, where is
that wretched man?!

03:40.654 --> 03:43.991
- You want the owner of this house?
- No.

03:43.991 --> 03:46.289
I am the master
of this house.

03:46.560 --> 03:47.995
I see...

03:47.995 --> 03:52.166
So that was Moronao's
house. But...

03:52.166 --> 03:56.069
Why is Moronao's onryou
pursuing Lord Yukinari?

03:56.069 --> 04:00.472
The truth is, Moronao was exiled
as he walked into a trap.

04:02.009 --> 04:06.446
And the man who set the trap
was Fujiwara no Koretada.

04:07.047 --> 04:08.949
Yukinari's grandfather!

04:08.949 --> 04:12.886
Yukinari even holds the same post
in the Seiryou quarters...

04:12.886 --> 04:15.787
that Koretada did when
he betrayed Moronao.

04:16.924 --> 04:19.193
Who is in charge up here?

04:19.193 --> 04:22.685
Lord Yu-Yukinari!
Lord Fujiwara no Yukinari!

04:23.297 --> 04:25.032
That means
the onryou thinks...

04:25.032 --> 04:27.668
Lord Yukinari was the one
who betrayed him,

04:27.668 --> 04:29.570
and he's trying to seek revenge?

04:29.570 --> 04:31.238
Masahiro.

04:31.238 --> 04:34.107
You must try your best
to stop the curse.

04:34.107 --> 04:36.777
If not, Lord Yukinari will...

04:36.777 --> 04:39.980
Yes, I'll definitely protect
Lord Yukinari.

04:39.980 --> 04:44.184
And I'll find a way to
save Toshitsugu,

04:44.184 --> 04:46.311
who's been possessed
by the onryou.

04:53.227 --> 04:56.830
- All right! Let's go, Mokkun.
- Masahiro?

04:56.830 --> 04:59.566
Oh... Wh-What is it?

04:59.566 --> 05:01.101
It's dried peach.

05:01.101 --> 05:05.037
It's not good for you to go
without eating dinner.

05:05.539 --> 05:07.307
Take these with you.

05:07.307 --> 05:10.043
You can eat them while walking.

05:10.043 --> 05:12.546
It's a good idea.
Take them with you.

05:12.546 --> 05:15.174
Peaches have the ability
to resist evil.

05:16.216 --> 05:18.241
They're delicious.

05:19.720 --> 05:22.587
- I'm glad you like them.
- Thank you.

05:23.156 --> 05:26.387
- Well, I'm off now.
- Please be careful.

05:36.003 --> 05:44.877
[chant]

05:45.579 --> 05:50.684
[chant]

05:50.684 --> 05:52.853
[chant]

05:52.853 --> 05:57.357
[chant]
Fujiwara no Yukinari,
you shall suffer!

05:57.357 --> 06:00.961
[chant]

06:00.961 --> 06:02.729
[chant]
Where is he?

06:02.729 --> 06:06.028
[chant]
Yukinari, where are you hiding?!

06:10.737 --> 06:12.806
I've set up a barrier.

06:12.806 --> 06:17.344
So the onryou won't be able
to see Lord Yukinari for now.

06:17.344 --> 06:19.175
By the way...

06:20.714 --> 06:24.017
Why don't you take some
of these dried peaches?

06:24.017 --> 06:26.386
Peaches have the ability
to resist evil.

06:26.386 --> 06:29.056
Please make sure
Lord Yukinari has some.

06:29.056 --> 06:32.259
Thank you. I'll take these
to him right now.

06:32.259 --> 06:33.851
Kouta.

06:34.695 --> 06:38.165
Listen, I promise you that
I'll use all my powers...

06:38.165 --> 06:40.834
to protect Lord Yukinari.

06:40.834 --> 06:44.235
Masahiro, I'm certain
you'll do your best.

07:08.595 --> 07:12.463
We should start putting the
finishing touches on our plan.

07:21.208 --> 07:26.613
Wind of chaos that caresses
the souls of those who sleep.

07:26.613 --> 07:29.282
Those confined by
the chains of darkness,

07:29.282 --> 07:33.275
arise and destroy,
plunging Earth into the abyss.

07:38.892 --> 07:42.225
Be prepared, Abe no Seimei!

07:46.600 --> 07:48.535
What is this?

07:48.535 --> 07:51.505
The shroud over the heavens
has collapsed.

07:51.505 --> 07:52.870
Let's go!

08:04.885 --> 08:08.321
The spirits that rest below
the ground have arisen.

08:11.158 --> 08:14.184
Purge the essence of
the enemy's curse! Go!

08:24.104 --> 08:28.336
It seems those spirits are
attracted to Moronao's curse.

08:28.775 --> 08:29.409
[chant]

08:29.409 --> 08:33.246
[chant]
Fujiwara no Yukinari,
where have you gone?!

08:33.246 --> 08:35.649
Darn you, onmyouji!

08:35.649 --> 08:38.785
You created a barrier
to hide him, didn't you?!

08:38.785 --> 08:42.687
Breaking it is such
an easy task for me!

08:46.927 --> 08:48.895
There you are!

08:48.895 --> 08:52.854
You can't run from me,
Fujiwara no Yukinari!

09:16.156 --> 09:18.258
Yukinari...

09:18.258 --> 09:21.250
Yukinari!

09:32.205 --> 09:35.106
I've got you now,
Hozumi no Moronao!

09:40.447 --> 09:42.210
What?!

09:48.054 --> 09:49.523
What is this?

09:49.523 --> 09:52.617
You may think you've
killed Lord Yukinari.

09:53.527 --> 09:57.197
But you're just holding
a cordial gift that...

09:57.197 --> 10:00.633
Lord Yukinari gave me for
my coming-of-age ceremony.

10:02.569 --> 10:04.935
You were fooled by
a decoy.

10:06.873 --> 10:11.478
It was an illusion of Yukinari
created by Masahiro's spell.

10:11.478 --> 10:13.571
Darn you!

10:14.814 --> 10:17.317
It's no use! You're trapped.

10:17.317 --> 10:20.787
You walked right into
the barrier that I made.

10:20.787 --> 10:23.490
No! Release me now!

10:23.490 --> 10:25.325
You're after the wrong man!

10:25.325 --> 10:29.062
Lord Fujiwara no Koretada was
the one who betrayed you.

10:29.062 --> 10:32.265
- Not Lord Yukinari!
- Shut up!

10:32.265 --> 10:36.202
Besides, the person you
want is already dead!

10:36.202 --> 10:39.865
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

10:43.710 --> 10:45.412
Hurry, Masahiro.

10:45.412 --> 10:48.548
His hatred is intense. The barrier
won't hold much longer.

10:48.548 --> 10:52.752
I know. Now that I've separated
him from Toshitsugu,

10:52.752 --> 10:56.552
Toshitsugu won't be implicated
if I exorcise him here.

10:57.624 --> 11:00.286
Wait. Something's coming.

11:05.765 --> 11:08.668
- Toshitsugu did it?
- No, it's not!

11:08.668 --> 11:11.398
Toshitsugu's curse should
already be broken.

11:20.246 --> 11:23.340
They are coming
from the capital.

11:29.422 --> 11:31.224
Taiin!

11:31.224 --> 11:33.927
Master Seimei instructed us
to come here.

11:33.927 --> 11:37.330
Tenitsu! What's happening
over at the capital?

11:37.330 --> 11:39.265
The spirits of the dead...

11:39.265 --> 11:43.303
who were buried in the capital
have been awakened.

11:43.303 --> 11:46.172
They were all drawn by
Moronao's curse.

11:46.172 --> 11:48.608
That's why they're gathering
here!

11:48.608 --> 11:51.511
Master Seimei, Seiryuu,
and the others...

11:51.511 --> 11:53.775
are trying to exorcise
them now.

12:12.098 --> 12:14.734
There seems to be
no end to this.

12:14.734 --> 12:17.070
There's actually someone
other than Seimei...

12:17.070 --> 12:19.698
who's capable of controlling
a spell of such power.

12:20.507 --> 12:24.944
Just listen to the charming
sound of catastrophe.

12:24.944 --> 12:29.149
Even the deities themselves
cannot stifle the desire...

12:29.149 --> 12:33.552
encapsulated in the prayers
of my heart... right now...

12:35.655 --> 12:38.954
There are numerous ghosts
dormant in the capital.

12:42.395 --> 12:45.732
If every single one of them
were to arise,

12:45.732 --> 12:47.867
no onmyouji, however powerful,

12:47.867 --> 12:50.670
would be able to exterminate
all of them.

12:50.670 --> 12:53.639
Well, I'm not too sure
about that.

12:55.575 --> 12:58.567
- Who exactly are you?
- Break!

13:03.149 --> 13:07.787
We just have to attack
the root of the problem first.

13:07.787 --> 13:11.758
Abe no Seimei! You aren't
supposed to be here!

13:11.758 --> 13:15.361
Weren't you involved in the
exorcism of Moronao's onryou?

13:15.361 --> 13:17.230
In this capital...

13:17.230 --> 13:20.927
there are other capable
onmyouji too.

13:22.001 --> 13:25.772
Lady, is this an attack
directed at me?

13:25.772 --> 13:29.209
Indeed. I thought that by
calling for Moronao's onryou,

13:29.209 --> 13:33.546
I was going to take
the life of Abe no Seimei.

13:33.546 --> 13:36.616
But it appears that
my plan has failed.

13:36.616 --> 13:41.287
However, now that
you are here...

13:41.287 --> 13:45.053
I will take your head home
as a trophy.

13:50.263 --> 13:54.700
But as that isn't your physical body,
I guess the trophy will have to wait.

13:55.735 --> 13:59.603
She's discovered...
that this is just my spirit...

14:00.173 --> 14:03.040
[chant]

14:05.278 --> 14:09.215
You may look like a young man,
but you sure don't fight like one.

14:09.215 --> 14:11.877
Longevity might not be
a good thing!

14:15.188 --> 14:18.316
- Seimei!
- Genbu!

14:25.665 --> 14:27.792
Audacious fool.

14:29.002 --> 14:31.571
Shut up, lady.

14:31.571 --> 14:35.241
You must be one of Seimei's
trusted Shikigami...

14:35.241 --> 14:38.912
- I'd like you to be my opponent.
- Nothing would please me more.

14:38.912 --> 14:41.181
Well, you are pretty spirited.

14:41.181 --> 14:44.241
But I wonder if you can
actually defeat me.

14:45.118 --> 14:46.553
That woman...

14:46.553 --> 14:50.683
She knows that Shikigami
isn't allowed to kill humans.

15:01.100 --> 15:03.796
We just have to slay
all of them, right?

15:04.537 --> 15:07.768
There are too many
of you, ghosts!

15:15.849 --> 15:20.687
I have neither the means nor the
power to fight like the others,

15:20.687 --> 15:23.022
but I will do my utmost
to protect you.

15:23.022 --> 15:24.891
Thank you.

15:24.891 --> 15:26.993
If we don't stop
these spirits now,

15:26.993 --> 15:31.692
they will engulf Toshitsugu
once I defeat Moronao.

15:32.498 --> 15:36.559
Let me out of here!
Release me right now!

15:38.738 --> 15:41.798
Oh no, Moronao's breaking
out of the barrier.

15:43.810 --> 15:45.778
She's on the offense.

15:45.778 --> 15:47.643
What the?

15:49.749 --> 15:51.614
You won't get your way!

15:52.218 --> 15:55.051
- Wave Shield!
- Break!

15:56.356 --> 15:58.654
- Genbu!
- Slicing Blade!

16:01.861 --> 16:03.963
Let me take your life now!

16:03.963 --> 16:05.624
Shield!

16:08.601 --> 16:10.569
Take that!

16:28.221 --> 16:31.891
Don't mess with me, lady.

16:31.891 --> 16:33.793
Seiryuu!

16:33.793 --> 16:38.253
Such a loyal shikigami...
That's great.

16:43.836 --> 16:45.463
Seiryuu!

16:46.539 --> 16:49.804
Abe no Seimei...
Prepare yourself!

16:56.549 --> 16:58.016
What should I do?

16:59.285 --> 17:01.185
So pesty!

17:04.891 --> 17:06.893
There is no end to this!

17:06.893 --> 17:12.832
What's a good way to exorcise
both the ghosts and Moronao?

17:14.467 --> 17:16.958
Masahiro, what now?

17:25.645 --> 17:27.408
That's right!

17:30.683 --> 17:32.819
Dried peaches...

17:32.819 --> 17:36.619
They have the ability to
resist evil. All right!

17:37.323 --> 17:40.292
[chant]

17:42.662 --> 17:44.931
This hand is not mine.

17:44.931 --> 17:49.769
This breath is not mine,
nor is this voice.

17:49.769 --> 17:53.206
It is hereby the hand,
the breath and the voice...

17:53.206 --> 17:55.265
of the deity of
Taka Maga Hara.

17:55.708 --> 17:57.977
Futsu no Mitama,
Totsuka no Tsurugi...

17:57.977 --> 17:59.842
The sovereign path
of the deity!

18:06.152 --> 18:09.986
Heaven and Earth,
receive the dead. Do it now!

18:25.071 --> 18:27.699
The peaches to ward off
evil spirits?

18:28.808 --> 18:30.977
They were supposed
to be my dinner.

18:30.977 --> 18:36.244
Well, you can't thank
Akiko more.

18:37.917 --> 18:41.910
Oh, I have to go
look for Toshitsugu.

18:46.159 --> 18:47.183
Seimei.

18:59.305 --> 19:01.000
Be bound!

19:07.780 --> 19:09.482
Who are you?

19:09.482 --> 19:12.585
I am Kazane.
What is your name?

19:12.585 --> 19:15.679
I am Rikugou, a Shikigami.

19:16.022 --> 19:20.015
Well, I think it's time
we called it a night.

19:22.195 --> 19:25.323
It looks like Moronao's onryou
has been defeated.

19:48.721 --> 19:50.518
Break!

19:59.632 --> 20:02.692
- Where am I?
- Toshitsugu...

20:03.336 --> 20:06.372
- How are you feeling?
- Masahiro!

20:06.372 --> 20:09.739
Where is this place?
How did I get here?

20:11.777 --> 20:15.214
Well, you went missing.

20:15.214 --> 20:16.849
What?!

20:16.849 --> 20:20.012
I remember I was exorcising
that onryou then...

20:20.419 --> 20:22.088
Wait, where is it now?

20:22.088 --> 20:24.613
Oh, he was sealed away safely.

20:24.857 --> 20:26.425
I see.

20:26.425 --> 20:30.663
He probably used the last of
his powers to bring me here.

20:30.663 --> 20:35.168
If you stay out here any
longer, you'll catch a cold.

20:35.168 --> 20:37.336
Why don't I take
you home?

20:37.336 --> 20:40.100
It's fine. I'll find
my way back.

20:41.674 --> 20:43.543
Thank you.

20:43.543 --> 20:46.546
You came out to
look for me, right?

20:46.546 --> 20:48.181
T-That's right.

20:48.181 --> 20:51.384
But it doesn't mean you can be late
for the onmyou dorms tomorrow.

20:51.384 --> 20:54.921
You'd better go back
and have a rest now.

20:54.921 --> 20:56.320
Yes!

21:01.827 --> 21:05.264
Gosh, was he thanking you,
or giving you a scolding?

21:05.264 --> 21:07.789
He should stick with
one or the other.

21:13.739 --> 21:16.742
She disturbs my divination...

21:16.742 --> 21:19.478
She also had enough
spiritual power...

21:19.478 --> 21:23.437
to revive Moronao's onryou
and the restless spirits.

21:23.549 --> 21:26.419
Who is she?

21:26.419 --> 21:29.388
This lady called Kazane...

21:42.868 --> 21:54.313
Everyone, as time passes,
loses sight of his dreams

21:54.313 --> 22:05.591
Errors and pains are repeated
through the ages

22:05.591 --> 22:11.430
Why do we resist believing
in each other?

22:11.430 --> 22:17.130
Why do we put out
the light of fate?

22:19.305 --> 22:29.548
I want to protect our future
with this hand

22:29.548 --> 22:36.455
Because you taught me

22:36.455 --> 22:41.627
What it means to challenge
with all my strength

22:41.627 --> 22:47.366
You will keep overcoming
your limits

22:47.366 --> 22:54.499
Surely surely surely

22:59.912 --> 23:02.574
Next Episode

23:23.302 --> 23:25.004
Next on Shonen Onmyouji...

23:25.004 --> 23:26.605
Episode 16.

23:26.605 --> 23:26.839
The Old Shadow Wanders
in the Night.

23:26.839 --> 23:29.171
Episode 16
The Old Shadow Wanders
in the Night
The Old Shadow Wanders
in the Night.
